{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0244_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9a77e9b3e21560691ce1ba7af88cbcc54e23e9776d14349e5ad031c9cafe53fc", "ja": "可憐、新しい衣装はどうだ？\nもちろん、似合うように仕立てて貰ったつもりだけど。", "zh": "可怜，新服装感觉怎么样？\n当然，我让他们制作的时候，就是奔着适合你的方向去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0244_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "6b7b756d976956bd13ce48ccb31e5aa131216f35d176bff05a261a3cfce4a104", "ja": "は、はい……。す、すごく、気に入ってます……！\nデザインも素敵ですし……新曲にもぴったりで……♪", "zh": "是、是的……我、我非常喜欢……！\n设计也很棒……和新歌也非常相配……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0244_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "52658886bf2361409e554a7f33095af8359ac5a6fec264499a010e7f7c9931fa", "ja": "で、でも……かわいい衣装って、\n着こなし方が、難しいですね……。", "zh": "但、但是……可爱的服装，\n要穿出感觉来，真的很难呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0244_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "be0d7b0c0100fe1f2016fd6f1c2bcdf6875cda200e7e1367e28886a882f67910", "ja": "わ、私としては、もっともっと……。\nか、かわいく着こなしたいんですけど……。", "zh": "我、我也想……\n穿得更、更加可爱一些……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0244_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f0395275b80437f10224c936f2ccc095717cc4a7675a05e5167d8cee3e539a03", "ja": "今でも着こなせてる気はするけど。\nそうだな……表情とか仕草を工夫してみたらどうかな？", "zh": "我觉得你现在已经穿得很好看了。\n这样吧……要不要试着在表情和动作上下点功夫？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
